{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/265b9eb9376dd2ac2aeb4cf36a385d94.avif?t=1770246180\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The pipes are scattered all over the site! Can you join them?\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pipeworks puzzle is new kind of sliding-tile puzzle. Move the pipes across the grid-based arena to connect the inlet to the outlet and complete the plumbing. There's a blueprint showing you how the pipes need to be connected, so there's no guesswork involved. But you can only move to empty tiles and your movement is restricted to the cardinal directions, so plan your next move carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/a7adc76350aa5853af980082f6be8bad.poster.avif?t=1770246180\" width=494 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/a7adc76350aa5853af980082f6be8bad.webm?t=1770246180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/a7adc76350aa5853af980082f6be8bad.mp4?t=1770246180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/60fc11b6a3465c2520ae4c0a795309f9.avif?t=1770246180\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take on the challenge you want!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many puzzles to tease your brain, with different difficulty levels. Too easy? Skip to the harder challenges. Want to relax for a while? Jump to one of the easier challenges. There is no restriction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/f3d3636d3865f7b8f345f858417cf919.avif?t=1770246180\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start as a rookie and rank up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on your new job as a plumber at the construction site. Start as a rookie and work your way up to become a master as you solve more  challenging puzzles. Each puzzle comes with a an added objective: solve it using the least amount of moves. Can you do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/65590ce37666a404981f710621cb8fb2.avif?t=1770246180\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute visuals and relaxing audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of levels with four difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional challenge to complete the levels with the least amount moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brain teaser with the option to choose the level difficulty based on your mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and intuitive control, using mouse only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best boss you'll ever have, created by the amazing artist PokuriMio</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/ff1206a0732e5813be939f4febc5979f.avif?t=1770246180\" width=616 height=355 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rookie No More!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/b1613df0e85e7c4fcddd11e9ad7e655bf98c1b63.jpg"},{"name":"Start of an apprenticeship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/16d68055ae924e78daad38a154c84e7432c8edfe.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned plumber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/b58f3875fd2c1b0e300127229059924836c40633.jpg"},{"name":"Pipeworks Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/095a8eb53b9e56cd2478b8d9d45047da30e2b302.jpg"},{"name":"Efficient plumber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/0852fd04b3805c6fbb2dda933fc99236f83b9673.jpg"},{"name":"The perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/7066aac8dc48b879ea7fa88943fdc7fe83ed8133.jpg"},{"name":"I came, I saw, I solved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/baa4869a4f55acf3dad242743ac0962a41e43850.jpg"},{"name":"Superstar Puzzle Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/aecf4f07955374cb005e02bdf6a00544c84d164a.jpg"},{"name":"What's a manual?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/259d8cee2a7d9c553793cbefcceb6dfb7fb035a8.jpg"},{"name":"Blueprint? No thanks!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3671420/31ae141dc31349ce18f95ab99ba549311547f0e0.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671420?t=1770246180","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/a0b6408cc6331d55127c3a6564b6b63b3de77381/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770246180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/5e8fdb73e6b69815e74472539b85329ea6f6d44b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770246180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/5e8fdb73e6b69815e74472539b85329ea6f6d44b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770246180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3790360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/265b9eb9376dd2ac2aeb4cf36a385d94.avif?t=1770246180\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The pipes are scattered all over the site! Can you join them?\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pipeworks puzzle is new kind of sliding-tile puzzle. Move the pipes across the grid-based arena to connect the inlet to the outlet and complete the plumbing. There's a blueprint showing you how the pipes need to be connected, so there's no guesswork involved. But you can only move to empty tiles and your movement is restricted to the cardinal directions, so plan your next move carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/a7adc76350aa5853af980082f6be8bad.poster.avif?t=1770246180\" width=494 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/a7adc76350aa5853af980082f6be8bad.webm?t=1770246180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671420/extras/a7adc76350aa5853af980082f6be8bad.mp4?t=1770246180\" type=\"video/m